      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just wondering if we could make the possible cases more clear as this is a bit hard to follow. I also think we don\u0027t always have to check each and every case, but I might be missing some.\n\nE.g. rather than to check every condition make this depend on whether we have a record in the cache.\n\n```python\n        # Have we previously counted this object?\n        if record \u003d\u003d self._label_count_cache.get(key)\n            if record.tenant and not tenant:\n                # We should decrement the tenant counter\n                self._tenant_label_nodes_used[\n                    (record.tenant, record.label)] -\u003d 1\n            elif record.provider and not provider:\n                # We should decrement the provider counter\n                self._provider_label_nodes_used[\n                    (record.provider, record.label)] -\u003d 1\n        else:\n            record \u003d self.NodeCountRecord()\n            record.tenant \u003d tenant\n            record.provider \u003d provider\n            record.label \u003d label\n            if record.tenant:\n                # We should increment the tenant counter\n                self._tenant_label_nodes_used[\n                    (tenant, label)] +\u003d 1\n            elif record.provider:\n                # We should increment the provider counter\n                self._provider_label_nodes_used[\n                    (provider, label)] +\u003d 1\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 260,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 280,
        "endChar": 39
      },
      "revId": "c1f7cc7eaf14c89b95caa4481ba46a090de2e124",
